***REMOVED*** ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
***REMOVED*** unpackerr ConfigMap. Connects unpackerr to Sonarr/Radarr. Copy to
***REMOVED*** `unpackerr-cm.yaml`, fill in. ArgoCD manages it.
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED***   cp unpackerr-cm.yaml.example unpackerr-cm.yaml
***REMOVED***   $EDITOR unpackerr-cm.yaml
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED*** PUID/PGID must match the UID/GID the *arr containers run as. The *_URL keys
***REMOVED*** are the in-cluster service URLs; *_API_KEY are the keys from Sonarr/Radarr
***REMOVED*** settings.
***REMOVED*** ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
apiVersion: v1
kind: ConfigMap
metadata:
    name: unpackerr-cm
    annotations:
        argocd.argoproj.io/sync-wave: "-1"
data:
    PGID: "REPLACE_WITH_GROUP_ID"
    PUID: "REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID"
    TZ: REPLACE_WITH_TIMEZONE
    UN_LOG_FILE: /data/unpackerr.log
    UN_LOG_FILE_MB: "10"
    UN_SONARR_0_URL: http://sonarr.starrs.svc.cluster.local:8989
    UN_SONARR_0_API_KEY: REPLACE_WITH_SONARR_API_KEY
    UN_SONARR_0_PATHS_0: /downloads/sonarr
    UN_RADARR_0_URL: http://radarr.starrs.svc.cluster.local:7878
    UN_RADARR_0_API_KEY: REPLACE_WITH_RADARR_API_KEY
    UN_RADARR_0_PATHS_0: /downloads/radarr
